{
  "dom_id": "step-e4624",
  "name": "Example: Identifying the Vertical Stretch of a Transformed Sine or Cosine Curve",
  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14256025/assets/505201a2f1bafb75bb5f4cb34f4abd02900df877fc1765a87a366d8681bd1fc0.png)\n\nThe graph above shows the function $y=A\\cos\\left(x+2\\right),$ where $A$ is a constant. What is $A?$",
  "worked_solution": "The constant $A$ is the amplitude of the function. \n\nFrom the graph, we see that the maximum value is $y_\\max=\\sqrt{2}$ and the minimum value is $y_\\min=-\\sqrt{2}.$ Therefore, the amplitude is\n\n$$\nA = \\dfrac{y_\\max-y_\\min}{2} = \\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}-(-\\sqrt{2})}{2}=\\sqrt{2}.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e4624\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Identifying the Vertical Stretch of a Transformed Sine or Cosine Curve</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e4624\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage